                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "D) Competition with PABA in folic acid synthesis.\n\nStudent: Thank you, Professor! Now I understand how dapsone works to treat bacterial and fungal infections as well as its immunomodulatory actions. I appreciate your step-by-step explanation.",
