                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Understand the definition of intestinal malabsorption. Intestinal malabsorption is a condition in which the small intestine is unable to absorb nutrients from food properly.\n\nStep 2: Research the different tests available for assessment of intestinal malabsorption.\n\nStep 3: Compare the tests to determine which is the best test for assessment of intestinal malabsorption.\n\nAnswer: A) Fecal fat estimation",
