                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the question\nThe question is asking for the best guide for managing resuscitation, which is the process of restoring normal physiological functions in a person who is experiencing a life-threatening event such as cardiac arrest or severe blood loss.\n\nStep 2: Analyze the options\nA) CVP (Central Venous Pressure): This is the pressure of blood in the thoracic vena cava, near the right atrium of the heart. It is an important parameter in evaluating the right ventricular function, but it may not be the best overall guide for resuscitation management.\nB) Urine output: This is an indirect measure of kidney function and can be an indicator of adequate blood flow and perfusion. However, it may not be the best overall guide for resuscitation management.\nC) Blood pressure: This is the pressure of blood in the circulatory system, and it is an important parameter for assessing the effectiveness of resuscitation efforts. It can provide information about the patient's overall perfusion and cardiovascular function.\nD) Saturation of Oxygen: This is the percentage of oxygen-saturated hemoglobin in the blood. It is an important parameter for assessing the effectiveness of oxygen delivery to the tissues, but it may not be the best overall guide for resuscitation management.\n\nStep 3: Determine the best answer\nBased on the analysis of the options, the best guide for the management of resuscitation is:\n\nC) Blood pressure\n\nBlood pressure is the most comprehensive parameter for assessing the effectiveness of resuscitation efforts, as it provides information about the patient's overall perfusion and cardiovascular function.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "4f41688d-2ffa-4143-94a6-873165bbf992",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
