                        "cot_trigger": "kojima-01",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n1. What kind of sampling is done?\n2. What is the population?\n3. What is the sample?\n4. What is the parameter?\n5. What is the hypothesis?\n6. What is the conclusion?\n7. What is the error?\n8. What is the power?\n9. What is the type I error?\n10. What is the type II error?\nB) Simple random sampling\nC) Stratified random sampling\nD) Cluster sampling\nThe correct answer is B) Simple random sampling.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "b2c91af9-663b-463c-bb1c-1248880f6103",
