                        "cot": "\n\nD) Country's achievement is computed on the basis of adult literacy. \n\nThis statement is false because the HDI calculation takes into account several factors, including life expectancy, education, and income. Adult literacy is just one component of the education factor, which itself only accounts for 2/3 of the overall HDI score.",
