                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": " \n\nStep 1: HDI stands for Human Development Index. \n\nStep 2: The calculation of HDI includes gross enrolment, adult literacy, and life expectancy. \n\nStep 3: Of the given statements, A) is incorrect because primary education is considered in gross enrolment. \n\nAnswer: A) In gross enrolment, only secondary education is considered, not primary education",
