                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": " \n\nA) In gross enrolment, only secondary education is considered, not primary education - False. All levels of education are considered in the calculation of the HDI.\n\nB) 1/3rd weightage is given to adult literacy - True. This is one of the three indicators used to calculate the HDI.\n\nC) 2/3`dweightage is given to gross enrolmen - False. The weight given to gross enrolment is 1/3, not 2/3. \n\nD) Country's achievement is computed on the basis of adult literacy - False. The country's achievement is computed on the basis of three indicators - life expectancy, adult literacy, and gross enrolment.",
