                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nProfessor:\n\nThe correct answer is A.\n\nStudent:\n\nWhy A?\n\nProfessor:\n\nA is the correct answer because reimplantation of an avulsed tooth is a surgical procedure and should be done within the first 20 minutes. The success rate of reimplantation decreases significantly after the first 20 minutes.\n\nStudent:\n\nWhat is the success rate of reimplantation?\n\nProfessor:\n\nThe success rate of reimplantation is highly dependent on the time of reimplantation. If the tooth is reimplanted within the first 20 minutes, the success rate is 90%. If the tooth is reimplanted after 20 minutes, the success rate is significantly lower.",
