                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Assess the condition of the avulsed tooth. Check for any fractures or damage to the root surface.\n\nStep 2: Clean the root surface with saline to remove any debris or contaminants.\n\nStep 3: Check the condition of the periodontal ligament. If it is intact, then proceed to reimplant the tooth.\n\nStep 4: If the periodontal ligament is not intact, then perform root canal treatment (RCT) to clean and curette the root surface before reimplanting the tooth.\n\nAnswer: B) Clean and curette root surface and reimplant",
