                        "cot": "\nMetformin causes lactic acidosis.\nFactors that increase the risk of lactic acidosis are:\nA) Advanced age\nB) Smoking\nC) Liver dysfunction\nD) Renal failure\n\nSo, we are looking for the answer that does not increase the risk of lactic acidosis.\nD) Renal failure",
