                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nMetformin causes a severe, sometimes life-threatening side effect of lactic acidosis. Factors that increase the risk of lactic acidosis include: advanced age, smoking, liver dysfunction, and renal failure.\n\nThe answer is B) Smoking. Smoking does not increase the risk of lactic acidosis.",
