                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nLactic acidosis is a side effect of metformin. Lactic acidosis is caused by the buildup of lactic acid in the blood. Lactic acid is produced by the muscles during exercise. Smoking is a risk factor for lactic acidosis.\n\nBased on this, the final answer is B.",
