                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": " Raw eggs contain proteins and fats, but no carbohydrates. Therefore, the patient is likely suffering from a deficiency in an enzyme that is involved in the metabolism of carbohydrates. The answer is D) Glucose 6 phosphatase.",
                        "answers": [
