                        "cot_trigger": "lievin-01",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's derive the differential diagnosis step by step: \n\n1. Pre-operational stage: This is the stage where a child is able to think about things symbolically. This stage occurs between the ages of 2-6 years. \n\n2. Operational stage: This is the stage where a child is able to think logically and solve problems. This stage occurs between the ages of 7-12 years.",
