                        "cot_trigger": "kojima-01",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n1. Cataract extraction surgery is a procedure to remove the lens of the eye that has become cloudy.\n2. Post-operative vision effects are the changes in vision after the surgery.\n3. PCB is post-cataract extraction surgery.\n4. We are looking for a type of surveillance.\n5. The correct answer is C) Passive surveillance.",
