                        "instruction": "qa-13",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "First, let's rephrase the question to ensure we understand it correctly: Which method is used to assess the impact on vision after cataract extraction surgery performed under PCB?\n\nNow, let's work this out step by step, spelling out our thoughts and reasoning so anyone can verify them:\n\nA) Active surveillance: This involves actively seeking out and collecting data on specific health events or outcomes. It is usually done for a limited period and in a specific population.\n\nB) Sentinel surveillance: This is a type of active surveillance where data is collected from a selected group of reporting sites or individuals, which are considered representative of the larger population. It is used to monitor trends and detect outbreaks or changes in disease patterns.\n\nC) Passive surveillance: This involves collecting data on health events or outcomes that are reported by healthcare providers, laboratories, or other sources without any active effort to seek out the information. It relies on the routine reporting of cases and may not capture all cases in a population.\n\nD) Routine checkup of all operated cases: This would involve regularly examining all patients who have undergone cataract extraction surgery under PCB to assess their post-operative vision effects.\n\nConsidering the options, the most appropriate method to evaluate post-operative vision effects after cataract extraction surgery under PCB would be:\n\nD) Routine checkup of all operated cases. This is because it ensures that all patients who have undergone the surgery are assessed for their post-operative vision effects, providing a comprehensive evaluation of the surgery's impact on vision.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "eafa21d7-4078-4f99-8161-90356299fec8",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "D) Routine checkup of all operated cases.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
                        "date": "2023/04/13 01:44:25",
                        "api_service": "openai_chat",
                        "model": "{'name': 'gpt-4', 'temperature': 0, 'max_tokens': 512}",
