                        "cot": "\nThe first step is to calculate the change in volume:\n\n500 mL - (-4 cm) = 504 mL\n\nThe next step is to calculate the change in pressure:\n\n-9 cm - (-4 cm) = -5 cm\n\nThe last step is to calculate the compliance:\n\n504 mL / -5 cm = 100.8 L/cm\n\nThe answer is D) 0.4 L cm.",
