                        "cot": "\n1. Retinitis pigmentosa: no\n2. Methanol poisoning: no\n3. Central retinal aerial occlusion (CRAO): no\n4. Polypoidal choroidal vasculopathy: yes\nD) Polypoidal choroidal vasculopathy",
