                    {
                        "id": "ab4f6cac-a3c2-48b6-9dc6-02e0a48a2992",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-10",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the question\nThe question is asking which of the given processes does not occur in the 5' to 3' direction. In molecular biology, the 5' to 3' direction refers to the orientation of nucleotides in a DNA or RNA molecule, with the 5' end having a phosphate group and the 3' end having a hydroxyl group.\n\nStep 2: Recall the processes and their directions\nA) DNA repair: DNA repair mechanisms, such as base excision repair and nucleotide excision repair, involve the synthesis of new DNA strands in the 5' to 3' direction.\nB) DNA replication: DNA replication occurs in the 5' to 3' direction, with new nucleotides being added to the 3' end of the growing DNA strand.\nC) RNA editing: RNA editing involves the modification of RNA molecules after transcription, such as the addition, deletion, or modification of nucleotides. This process does not have a specific direction, as it can occur at any position within the RNA molecule.\nD) Transcription: Transcription is the process of synthesizing RNA from a DNA template. The RNA polymerase enzyme synthesizes the RNA strand in the 5' to 3' direction.\n\nStep 3: Identify the process that doesn't occur in the 5' to 3' direction\nFrom the information in Step 2, we can see that RNA editing (C) does not have a specific direction and can occur at any position within the RNA molecule. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\nC) RNA editing",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "ecb92055-616d-47eb-8ca7-4537c1aa5fad",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "C) RNA editing",
                                "answer_from_choices": "C",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
                        "date": "2023/04/14 18:41:06",
                        "api_service": "openai_chat",
                        "model": "{'name': 'gpt-4', 'temperature': 0, 'max_tokens': 512}",
                        "comment": "",
