                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "A) DNA repair occurs in the 5' to 3' direction.\nB) DNA replication also occurs in the 5' to 3' direction.\nC) RNA editing does not have a specific direction, as it involves modifications to the RNA molecule after transcription.\nD) Transcription occurs in the 5' to 3' direction.\n\nSo, the correct answer is C) RNA editing.",
