                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nQuestion: Which of the following does not occur in the 5' to 3' direction?\n\nAnswer: C) RNA editing.\n\nReasoning: DNA repair, DNA replication, and transcription all occur in the 5' to 3' direction. This is because the 5' to 3' direction is the direction of the flow of genetic information from the DNA to the RNA. RNA editing, however, occurs in the opposite direction, from the RNA to the DNA. Therefore, C) RNA editing is the answer.",
