                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStudent: What is a positive pivot shift test?\n\nProfessor: A positive pivot shift test is when the knee joint is injured and the knee is unable to move properly.\n\nStudent: Why does this happen?\n\nProfessor: This happens because the ligaments that support the knee joint are damaged.\n\nStudent: Which ligaments are damaged?\n\nProfessor: The posterior cruciate ligament and the anterior cruciate ligament are damaged.\n\nStudent: What is the treatment for this?\n\nProfessor: The treatment for this is surgery to repair the ligaments.",
