                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe correct answer is D) enables windmills to power electric grids.\n\nDecaying vegetation is part of the process of creating energy from windmills. Windmills use the kinetic energy of the wind to turn a turbine, which is connected to a generator. The generator then produces electricity, which is then used to power electric grids. The decaying vegetation is used to create the wind that turns the turbine, which is then used to generate electricity. Therefore, decaying vegetation is part of the process that enables windmills to power electric grids.",
