                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Understand the question.\n\nThe question is asking which instance light from further away may appear to be less bright than other, closer sources.\n\nStep 2: Read the answer choices.\n\nA) the sun is always bright\nB) the moon is brighter than stars\nC) the moon is brighter than a floodlight\nD) the sun is darker than the moon\n\nStep 3: Eliminate answer choices that are not correct.\n\nA) the sun is always bright - This is incorrect because the sun is not always bright.\n\nStep 4: Choose the correct answer.\n\nThe correct answer is B) the moon is brighter than stars. This is because the moon is closer to us than stars, so it appears brighter.",
