                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nA) dry, grass covered, and humid - This is not a typical desert environment. Deserts are usually arid and dry, not humid.\n\nB) lush, green, and tropical - This is also not a typical desert environment. Deserts are usually arid and dry, not lush and green.\n\nC) arid, parched, and sun-baked - This is a typical desert environment. Deserts are usually arid and dry, with lots of sun.\n\nD) dry, damp, and lush - This is not a typical desert environment. Deserts are usually arid and dry, not damp and lush.\n\nAnswer: C) arid, parched, and sun-baked",
