                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "First, let's rephrase the question: What kind of beneficial product can be generated from the motion of wind?\n\nNow, let's work this out step by step:\n\nA) Wood - Wood is a material that comes from trees, not from wind. So, this option is not correct.\n\nB) Bananas - Bananas are fruits that grow on plants, not a product generated from wind. So, this option is not correct.\n\nC) Electricity - Wind can be harnessed through wind turbines to generate electricity. This is a useful product that can be made from the moving winds. So, this option seems correct.\n\nD) Metal - Metal is a material that is extracted from ores found in the earth, not from wind. So, this option is not correct.\n\nAfter analyzing each option, we can conclude that the correct answer is:\n\nC) Electricity",
