                        "cot": "\n\nStep 1: Identify the properties of moving winds. Moving winds are a form of energy, so they can be used to generate power.\n\nStep 2: Consider what type of product can be made from the energy generated by the moving winds. Electricity is the most common form of energy generated from moving winds, so it is the most likely answer.\n\nAnswer: C) Electricity",
