                        "cot": "A) Regurgitation: This is not the correct option as regurgitation refers to the process of bringing up undigested food from the stomach to the mouth.\n\nB) Decomposition: This is a possible option as decomposition refers to the process of breaking down dead organisms into simpler substances by the action of bacteria, fungi, and other decomposers.\n\nC) Recycling: This is a possible option as recycling refers to the process of reusing materials or resources to create new products.\n\nD) Burial: This is not the correct option as burial refers to the process of covering or interring a dead body or organism.\n\nCombining all the information, the correct answer is B) Decomposition. Worms play a crucial role in the decomposition process by breaking down dead organisms and returning nutrients to the soil.",
