                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStudent: What is the process called when worms return nutrients from dead organisms to the soil by eating them?\n\nProfessor: That would be decomposition.\n\nStudent: Could you explain how you got that answer?\n\nProfessor: Well, when worms eat dead organisms, they break them down and return the nutrients to the soil. This process is essential for new life to grow.",
