                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe correct answer is B) decomposition.\n\nDecomposition is the process of breaking down dead organisms into simpler forms of matter, such as carbon dioxide, water, and minerals. Worms play an important role in this process by consuming dead organisms and returning the nutrients to the soil. This process is known as decomposition, as opposed to regurgitation, recycling, or burial.",
